@startuml
title Вариант 1: основная доставка push
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
autonumber
participant "Банковский сервис\nи его outbox" as Bank
participant "API + Relay" as API
database "Critical Ledger\nPostgreSQL HA" as DB
queue Kafka
participant "Orchestrator\nScheduler" as O
participant "Channel Worker" as W
participant "Policy Service" as Policy
participant "Push provider" as Push
actor "Приложение" as App
participant "Receipt Receiver" as R
Bank -> API: POST notification; стабильный event ID
API -> DB: TX: unique key + notification + outbox
DB --> API: Commit с sync replica
API --> Bank: 202 + notification ID
API -> Kafka: Outbox: notification accepted; acks=all
Kafka -> O: Critical event (возможен повтор)
O -> DB: TX: inbox + READY + due time
O -> Kafka: Commit offset после SQL commit
O -> DB: Due row: CAS generation + attempt + dispatch outbox
API -> Kafka: Dispatch outbox
Kafka -> W: Send attempt ID
W -> Policy: Разрешение по актуальной политике
Policy --> W: Permit + policy version + контакт
W -> DB: CAS: не DELIVERED, актуальный attempt, не expired
DB --> W: Разрешено; транзакция завершена
W -> Push: Send(notification ID, attempt ID)
Push --> W: Accepted + provider message ID
W -> DB: Записать PROVIDER_ACCEPTED / deadline
note over W,Push: Accepted ещё не означает DELIVERY_CONFIRMED
Push -> App: Push
App -> R: Аутентифицированный ACK(notification ID, attempt ID)
R -> DB: TX: receipt inbox + DELIVERED + status outbox
DB --> R: Commit
R --> App: 200
O -> DB: Старый таймер: DELIVERED => no-op
note over DB,O: Новые разрешения резерва не выдаются
@enduml
